Package: btrfs-qgroup-dkms
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, initramfs-tools, linux-headers-amd64, mokutil, openssl
Maintainer: Local Btrfs Module Maintainer <root@localhost>
Description: DKMS build of the locally patched Btrfs module
 Builds the patched Btrfs filesystem module for installed Debian kernels,
 signs it with the enrolled Secure Boot key, and installs it under
 updates/dkms so it takes precedence over the distribution module.
